      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but it feels like the \"pro\" side is mostly about giving kids freedom and better chances, while the \"con\" side is just about protecting the current system and keeping money in public schools. isnt it kind of a lopsided debate if you look at the actual benefits for the kids vs just protecting institutions?",
